fullDescription:
A game in which you need to explore new oil fields. For this you will have different ways, such as moles, geologists and so on. Build towers, oil storages, pump your production, improve buildings and warehouses. Hire workers, guards, fight off or buy off raiders. Buy new lands. 
 
Features: 
 
-enjoyable graphics; 
-simple controls; 
-interesting gameplay; 
- light music; 
- unforgettable adventures;

Near future. You play as the agronomist immigrant Taras Bulbenko from the Kharkiv region, who is hiding from enemies in Canada and is hunted by a creditor. Your task is to survive alone, doing ordinary peasant things. 
The game is waiting for you: 
- Lonely typical village life; 
- Planting potatoes; 
- Planting sunflowers, watermelons, beets; 
- Fishing; 
- Diving; 
- Pest control from the garden; 
- Injuries in the household; 
- Brewing moonshine; 
- Contact with extraterrestrial civilizations; 
- Kharkiv city. 
In addition to this: 
- A large number of references to modernity with highlights; 
- Full Ukrainian voiceover with some elements of Slobid dialect. 
Also if Taras Bulbenko was in space, on Earth he remains as an agronomist from the village of Rohan. You will plant plants genetically modified by Taras, feed a small farm, swim underwater to find unique plants, cool off in the river after a working day, breaw and drink moonshine, and even poison a Colorado beetle. With the accompaniment of sounds familiar to many of us.

Think before jumping. In this puzzle platformer you will have to control a little rice ball called Ricy. Help him reaching his goal by teleporting him to his reflected position. 
 
Features: 
- 30 handcrafted levels with progressive difficulty; 
- Beaultiful pixel art synthwave-themed; 
- A new mechanic is introduced every 3 levels (sort of); 
- Eastern elements (it's a rice ball near Mout Fuji and checkpoints are chopsticks); 
- Original soundtrack synthwave-themed;
